  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">AGELOCER is a new-generation mechanical watch brand in China founded in 2013, mainly engaged in movement research and development and watch manufacturing. AGELOCER gives new design vitality to mechanical watches, develops more high-quality Chinese movements, and is committed to creating mechanical timepieces that meet the tastes of young people.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: mechanical watches for men and women. <br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Designed by expertise in the Swiss watch industry. <br>&bull; Payment terms: Paypal<br>&bull; Other information: </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">AGELOCER brand gathers outstanding designers and watchmaking teams from all over the world to break the stereotypes of traditional watchmaking, show a distinctive aesthetic mark, and reinterpret traditional watchmaking as a mechanical watch with the genes of the new era. AGELOCER has its own insights and pursuits for watchmaking technology. The product team runs through the whole line from design drawing, plate making, accessories production, manual assembly, and testing, and is committed to developing excellent watchmaking cores.</p>\r\n</div>",
